---
source: crates/binsight/tests/help.rs
expression: "help_of(&[\"--help\"]).await"
---
Self-hostable portfolio tracker for Meteora DLMM liquidity positions, with exact, on-chain verified PnL

Usage: binsight [OPTIONS] <COMMAND>

Commands:
  init   Write a configuration file with your Helius API key and password (asked without echo)
  run    Run the server: open and upgrade the database, start the engine, serve the API and the web app until stopped (Ctrl-C or SIGTERM)
  admin  Inspect and maintain an installation
  help   Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)

Options:
      --config-file <PATH>  The configuration file to read [default: $XDG_CONFIG_HOME/binsight/binsight.env or ~/.config/binsight/binsight.env]
  -h, --help                Print help
  -V, --version             Print version
